      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ESCAPING TIME (7) carved over from wide out and boxed on strongly to finish one length away in second (22.30) behind Mia's Impact at this track. Rates highly and will give a great sight. FELON DAVE (1) was midfield throughout and finished there last time when 4th (22.64) at this track. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. TINY VIOLIN (2) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Scratch Daddy (22.59) in a Novice race. Has the pace to be prominent. Has never been out of the placings from three starts out of this box. Bold showing expected. TIDE IS HIGH (5) is not to be discarded.",
